      "title": "Per-keystroke rename validation reuses token validator",
      "message": "Rename is validated with validTokenText, which also gates the item Text and the checklist ID. The error message says 'nonblank and at most256 bytes', but if validTokenText rejects whitespace or control characters or has other restrictions, valid user edits are refused. In an editable TextField, every keystroke fires Change, so clearing the field mid-edit reports an Invalid error and the field state can desync.",
